# Global Sanctuary — hand-curated starter set of well-known places of worship.
#
# Used as the Phase 1 sample dataset when the Wikidata script can't be run.
# Coordinates are approximate (typically within ~100 m) and should be replaced
# by `npm run data:fetch` (Wikidata) when you have internet access.
#
# Columns (pipe-separated):
# name | faith | tradition | city | country | lat | lon | unesco (1/0) | english wikipedia title
#
# faith keys: christianity, islam, judaism, hinduism, buddhism, sikhism, shinto,
#             jainism, bahai, chinese, zoroastrianism, other
#
